{A deer jumps a fence}

A deer named Diane lived in a lush forest surrounded by tall trees and winding streams. She spent her days roaming freely, exploring every nook and cranny of her home. One day, while leaping over a fallen log, Diane saw something glinting in the distance.

As she approached, she realized it was a shimmering meteorite that had crashed into the earth.

